  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide food, water, and critical care in Haiti.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sonje-Ayiti&apos;s work continues amidst chaos, violence, Cholera, lockdowns, roadblocks, lack of food, water, medicine and power.  Case managers support 100 community members in a program to alleviate extreme poverty. Food is safely distributed or stipends given to the families of many of the 296 students now unable to have a daily meal to buy seeds for fast-growing crops. Treatment and monitoring are provided to 52 severely malnourished children, and mental health community support for depression.</narrative>
  </description>
